      },
      {
        "id": "ushiro.epilogue.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/ushiro-epilogue-photo-count-chaos-v2.png",
        "alt": "人数確認不能の全館合同記念写真の一枚絵"
      },
      {
        "id": "ushiro.epilogue.asset.still.002",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/ushiro-epilogue-one-chosen-shadow-reward-v1.png",
        "alt": "百二十七の影が一人に収束し、カメラを構える一枚絵"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "ushiro.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあと、闘技場の恒例行事が一つ増えた。「全館合同記念写真」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "従業員も選手もお客様も、来たい人は全員写っていい。年に一度の大撮影会だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "発案者は、記念撮影所の新スタッフ。つまり、うしろだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "当日の朝、アトリウムは大混雑だった。整列の途中から、参加者が気づき始める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あれ、隣の人の後ろに、同じ人が……」「うちの列にも」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「こっちにも!」百二十七人が、全員の背後に、律儀に写り込み待機していた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "ushiro.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "実行委員が「参加人数の最終確認を」と言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三分後、「人数確認、不能!」と晴れやかに宣言。拍手が起きた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "数えられないのは、うちの闘技場では、もう祝いごとの一種だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "皆様、お待たせしました。……本日の撮影者は、私が務めます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アトリウムが、静かにどよめいた。写り込みの名人が、今日は撮る側に立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "百二十七の影が、ゆっくりと一人に集まっていく。たった一人になった彼が、カメラを構える。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "ushiro.epilogue.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "写りたい影だけ、どうぞ前へ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "——はい、そのまま。誰も、振り返らないで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は最前列で、二本の飲み物を持って写った。一本は私の。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "もう一本は、撮影が終わったら、撮影者に渡すぶんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "振り返らない約束なので、シャッターの瞬間の彼の顔は見ていない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも、いい顔をしていたはずだ。ファインダー越しに、全員の正面を見られる日なのだから。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "柿落としの出演届は、撮影の翌日に貼り出された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "演目「全館記念撮影(写りたい影だけ、どうぞ前へ)」備考——「人数確認は、しません」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "現像、できました。……ミミさんの写真、今回も、よく撮れています。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたの背後は、その、……当日は満席でしたので、私は写っていませんが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受け取った写真の隅、私の飲み物の影が、よく見ると二本ぶん伸びていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "写っていないのに、写っている。うしろの写真は、いつもそういう写真だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私はその一枚を、従業員証の裏に入れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.line.010d",
      "lineId": "ushiro.epilogue.line.010d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳の先まで、ちょっとあたたかい。見守りは、携帯するに限る。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "ushiro.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
